.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.6 21 3 13.4 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.2c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.2.2 2.4.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1L6.6 10z\"/></svg></a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn primary btn-lg\" href=\"#contact\">Hire Me →</a>\n      <a class=\"btn link-secondary\" href=\"#hooklab\">Try the Hook Lab</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mouse\"><span></span></div>\n  <div class=\"h-story\">\n    <div class=\"h-beats\">\n      <div class=\"h-beat\">\n        <span>01 · Tester</span>\n        <b>QA Engineer</b>\n        <p>2007–2014 — learned to break systems &amp; find root causes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"h-beat\">\n        <span>02 · Marketer</span>\n        <b>Performance Marketer</b>\n        <p>2015–2023 — Rs.2L+/mo budgets, CPL −30%, ROAS 3.2x → 5.5x.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"h-beat\">\n        <span>03 · Builder</span>\n        <b>AI Product Builder</b>\n        <p>2024–now — shipping the AI tools that run campaigns. Solo.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"h-progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span></div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"impact\" aria-label=\"Proven results\">\n  <div class=\"impact-item\"><b>−30%</b><span>Cost-per-lead</span><small>Rs.1,100 → Rs.770</small></div>\n  <div class=\"impact-item\"><b>3.2x → 5.5x</b><span>Client ROAS</span><small>same budget</small></div>\n  <div class=\"impact-item\"><b>+15%</b><span>Organic traffic</span><small>audits + technical SEO</small></div>\n  <div class=\"impact-item\"><b>70+</b><span>Leads / month</span><small>qualified, measurable</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"stats reveal\">\n    <div class=\"stat\"><b class=\"count\" data-target=\"10\" data-suffix=\"+\">10+</b><i>Years Experience</i></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><b class=\"count\" data-target=\"15\" data-suffix=\"%\">15%</b><i>Organic Traffic Growth</i></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><b class=\"count\" data-target=\"70\">70</b><i>Qualified Leads / Mo</i></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><b>Rs.2L+</b><i>Monthly Ad Budget</i></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><b class=\"count\" data-target=\"3\">3</b><i>Live AI Products</i></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mini-cta reveal\"><span>Hiring? See the <a href=\"/hire-recruiters.html\">roles I'm built for</a> — then send 3 lines.</span></div>\n</div><section id=\"growth\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">Free growth audit · latest reads</span>\n      <h2>Get a free growth plan — or start with what I ship</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid2\" style=\"gap:22px;align-items:stretch\">\n      <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;background:var(--card)\">\n        <h3>Free 30-min growth audit</h3>\n        <p style=\"color:var(--muted)\">Pick SEO, paid media, or AI automation. You'll leave with 3-5 concrete fixes - no pitch, just the plan.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:14px\">\n          <a class=\"btn link-secondary\" href=\"/seo.html#ctaForm\">SEO &amp; Content -&gt;</a>\\n          <a class=\"btn link-secondary\" href=\"/ads.html#ctaForm\">Paid Media -&gt;</a>\\n          <a class=\"btn link-secondary\" href=\"/ai-automation.html#ctaForm\">AI Automation -&gt;</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;background:var(--card)\">\n        <h3>Latest thinking</h3>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px\"><a href=\"/blog/technical-seo-for-your-own-portfolio.html\">Technical SEO for your own portfolio</a></p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px\"><a href=\"/blog/case-study-restructuring-paid-media-cut-cpl-30.html\">Restructuring paid media cut CPL 30%</a></p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0\"><a href=\"/blog/creative-predictor-ai-predicts-your-ads-performance.html\">The AI that predicts ad creative performance</a></p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a class=\"btn link-secondary\" href=\"/blog.html\">Read all 7 posts -&gt;</a></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section id=\"about\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:920px\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">About Me + Live Chat</span>\n      <h2>Ask my portfolio anything</h2>\n      <p style=\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px\">Live RAG - every answer is grounded in my real documents (<code style=\"font-family:ui-monospace\">api/kb.js</code>), or read the full <a href=\"/about.html\" style=\"color:var(--accent2);font-weight:600\">about page →</a></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"reveal\">\n<div id=\"terminal\">\n        <div class=\"term-bar\">\n          <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#ff5f56\"></span>\n          <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#ffbd2e\"></span>\n          <span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#27c93f\"></span>\n          <span style=\"margin-left:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;font-family:ui-monospace\">vamshidhar@portfolio: ~ — tap a question (or press ?)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"term-body\" id=\"termBody\">\n          <div class=\"out\"><span class=\"c3\">➜</span> welcome to my portfolio. ask me anything 👇</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qs\">\n          <button data-q=\"what\">What do you do?</button>\n          <button data-q=\"ppc\">Show a PPC win</button>\n          <button data-q=\"ai\">Your AI tools</button>\n          <button data-q=\"edge\">The edge</button>\n          <button data-q=\"hire\">Why hire you?</button>\n          <button data-q=\"role\">Match a role</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"term-input\">\n          <input id=\"chatIn\" type=\"text\" placeholder='type \"seo\", \"ppc\", \"hire\"…' aria-label=\"Ask me anything\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n          <button id=\"micBtn\" aria-label=\"Ask with your voice\" title=\"Ask with your voice\" hidden>🎙️</button>\n          <button id=\"chatSend\" aria-label=\"Send message\">➤</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"chat-tools\" id=\"chatTools\">\n          <button id=\"btClear\">🗑 Clear chat</button>\n          <button id=\"btCopy\">📋 Copy last Q&A</button>\n          <button id=\"btEmail\">📧 Email me this chat</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ragnote\">⚡ Live RAG — answers are grounded in my real documents (<b>api/kb.js</b>), then answered by an LLM.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section><div class=\"marquee\"><div class=\"roll\" id=\"marq\"></div></div>\n\n<section id=\"projects\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">Projects</span>\n      <h2>Built with Code &amp; Marketing Instinct</h2>\n      <p>Three live products I designed, built, and launched solo. Run them yourself — health badges check them in real time.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pgrid\">\n      <div class=\"pcard reveal\">\n        <div class=\"sub\">Growth SaaS · built solo</div><div class=\"ico\">🎯</div>\n        <h3>Hook AI — Marketing Copy Engine</h3>\n        <p>An AI engine that writes conversion-ready hooks, headlines, and ad copy across 15+ niches — with its own full SEO program, email flows, and A/B hero testing.</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\"><span>Next.js</span><span>Supabase</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>Razorpay</span><span>Groq AI</span><span>Vercel</span></div>\n        <span class=\"status-badge checking\" data-url=\"https://hook-ai-marketing-engine.vercel.app\"><span class=\"sdot\"></span>Checking</span>\n        <div class=\"links\"><a href=\"https://hook-ai-marketing-engine.vercel.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Live →</a><a href=\"https://github.com/gitvamshidhar-m/hook-ai-marketing-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pcard reveal\">\n        <div class=\"sub\">Paid Media &amp; CRO suite · v13.0</div><div class=\"ico\">📈</div>\n        <h3>Creative Predictor</h3>\n        <p>Paste any ad creative and get predicted CTR, engagement &amp; conversion, plus 20+ modules — quality score, A/B testing, competitor decoder, landing-page analyzer.</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\"><span>Groq Llama 3.3</span><span>OpenAI</span><span>HuggingFace</span><span>hf.space</span></div>\n        <span class=\"status-badge checking\" data-url=\"https://mvamshi56-creative-predictor.static.hf.space/index.html\"><span class=\"sdot\"></span>Checking</span>\n        <div class=\"links\"><a href=\"https://mvamshi56-creative-predictor.static.hf.space/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Live →</a></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pcard reveal\">\n        <div class=\"sub\">Growth Strategy · funnel-based</div><div class=\"ico\">🚀</div>\n        <h3>AI Growth Strategy Generator</h3>\n        <p>Answer a quick wizard — industry, budget, KPI targets (CPA/ROAS) — and get a personalized, budget-optimized, effort-vs-impact-scored marketing plan.</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\"><span>Next.js</span><span>Guided Wizard</span><span>Vercel</span></div>\n        <span class=\"status-badge checking\" data-url=\"https://strategy-generator-kwdf-beta.vercel.app\"><span class=\"sdot\"></span>Checking</span>\n        <div class=\"links\"><a href=\"https://strategy-generator-kwdf-beta.vercel.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Live →</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"receipts reveal\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">Receipts</span>\n      <h3>Proof of work, not promises</h3>\n      <div class=\"receipt-grid\">\n        <div class=\"r-item\"><b>Rs.1,100 → Rs.770</b><span>cost-per-lead</span><small>client PPC account · 2024–25</small></div>\n        <div class=\"r-item\"><b>3.2x → 5.5x</b><span>client ROAS</span><small>same budget · case study below</small></div>\n        <div class=\"r-item\"><b>40+ → 8</b><span>ad groups consolidated</span><small>paid-media restructure</small></div>\n        <div class=\"r-item\"><b>+15%</b><span>organic traffic</span><small>Autozilla · since May 2023</small></div>\n        <div class=\"r-item\"><b>70+</b><span>qualified leads / mo</span><small>Autozilla · current</small></div>\n        <div class=\"r-item\"><b>Rs.2L+</b><span>ad budget managed</span><small>monthly, hands-on</small></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"r-cta\"><a href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/case-study-restructuring-paid-media-cut-cpl-30.html\">Read the full case study →</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/case-study-organic-traffic-15-percent-combined-with-paid.html\">Organic SEO case study →</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog.html\">More on the blog →</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"live\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">Live from GitHub</span>\n      <h2>Ship logs — pulled in real time</h2>\n      <p>My repos, fetched live from the GitHub API. No fake data here — this section updates itself.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ghgrid reveal\" id=\"ghbox\">\n      <div class=\"skel\"><span style=\"width:55%\"></span><span style=\"width:85%\"></span><span style=\"width:40%\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"skel\"><span style=\"width:50%\"></span><span style=\"width:80%\"></span><span style=\"width:42%\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"skel\"><span style=\"width:60%\"></span><span style=\"width:75%\"></span><span style=\"width:38%\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section id=\"liveCmd\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">Live Command Center</span>\n      <h2>This page is being watched, right now</h2>\n      <p>Real-time analytics pulled from my site when you opened it. Refreshes every 20s — no fake numbers.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"livecmd reveal grid2\" id=\"liveCmdBox\">\n      <div class=